[Whether][ marketing] to stoners crosses[ an] ethical[ line][ or] not[,] it certainly[ seems] to[ be] working. Taco Bell[ has][ seen] its[ sales] spike by 6 percent[ since] launching its "late-night munchies"[ advertisements].[ The][ marketing][ has] been so successful[ that] at least one new upstart fast[-][food] enterprise

